  "native_boundary_rules": [
    "Keep request origin, fixed path prefix, audience and delegated scope separate; sharing TeamsAdminAPI does not authorize the ConfigAPI tuple",
    "Resolve cloud/tenant/principal once and bind requests; tenantID path inputs come from that session, not arbitrary caller substitution",
    "Cache and rejected-token refresh isolation must include tenant, full cloud tuple, principal, auth mode, audience and requested scope set",
    "Region.Read.All must remain explicit; do not rewrite to .default or infer application permission from delegated scope",
    "No default commercial routing for unqualified sovereign clouds; isolated helper rejection is not a full-command or service denial",
    "No wildcard Teams-host credential forwarding, automatic profile fallback or Graph/ConfigAPI token substitution"
  ],
